{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act21side_level_act21side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act21side",
  "stageId": "act21side_06",
  "title": "Old Conflicts",
  "storyCode": "IS-6",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "cac1eb78ef2cb06c812a0076389bd1e106d9020a338b9e4af62bbee47e8a90fb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Back up, this one's tricky."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Don't fight her head on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Cover the aisles and the stairs leading up to the Donna's box!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "Tsk, tsk. Rossati soldiers are pretty capable after all, huh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "Looks like trying to brute force my way through isn't a realistic option."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "Hmm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "Haha, silly Texas. It's pretty obvious she's got a recorder in that bass."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "Sounds convincing, though, the way she's plucking those strings."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "Hm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "Haha, there it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "If I can't break through the front... I'll just have to make a path!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Don't panic!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Stand your ground!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bellone Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "Gah, aren't you afraid to die?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Guh... Urgh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "text": "How are the others doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bellone Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "The aisles and stairs leading to Giovanna's box are all guarded."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bellone Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "They were ready for this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "text": "Leave it to the Rossatis..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "text": "But, we've never been ones to underestimate Giovanna."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "text": "Throw more soldiers at them. We're not letting Giovanna out today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "You might not have underestimated Giovanna, but don't you think you underestimated me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bellone Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "What—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "text": "You're... Wallach."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "Heh, had I known the show today would've been so exciting, I wouldn't have gone to buy a drink for the Donna."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "text": "If Signora Giovanna appreciates a fine wine, I happen to have a selection with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "No thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "The Donna enjoys many things about Siracusa, but the wine isn't one."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "Siracusan wines are too weak, same as you people swing your weapons. Doesn't make for a good time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "text": "Maybe you just haven't tried the best Siracusa has to offer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "So, isn't this a great opportunity?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "Do you know how long I've been waiting for this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "Bellones and Saluzzos, let's find out what Siracusa's finest wine really tastes like."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Trying to get up this way?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Stop her!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "Who said I was going up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "What? Explosives?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Get outta there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "text": "Woah, the seats over yonder just collapsed!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "text": "Is that... Lappland?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horrified Audience",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Look over there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Urgh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horrified Audience",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I-Is it another famiglie gang war...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "text": "Move."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Sh-She had weapons in her instrument?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_684_1",
      "text": "Texas!"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Texas says nothing. She only shoots her a glance, parting her lips for a second before rushing up the stairs.\nSora reads those lips.\nShe said: 'Wait for me.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Panicked Audience",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Aaaaaahhh—! Run! Run for it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "text": "What'cha think we oughta do, Exusiai? Sora's in danger!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "text": "But—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horrified Audience",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "S-Someone, save me—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "text": "Get down!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "text": "Woah, you're pretty tough for an old guy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_692_1",
      "text": "Do I look that old to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "text": "Uhh... Well, I guess I wouldn't go that far."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_692_1",
      "text": "Looks like today's performance is not 'La Morte di Texas,' but rather 'La Morte di Rossati.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_692_1",
      "text": "Find somewhere to hide, children."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "text": "That sounds nice, but our friend is still up there on stage."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "text": "It's a gat-danged hurricane all 'round the thing! We can't just go hoppin' on into that!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "text": "Let's go backstage then!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "text": "Okay!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "text": "C'mon, outta my way!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_692_1",
      "text": "Go, brave children."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "text": "Thanks, old man!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "text": "I'll buy you a slice later!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "text": "Thank ya kindly!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_692_1",
      "text": "Haha, kids these days are so full of pep."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_692_1",
      "text": "What's your plan now, Giovanna?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Donna Giovanna, we've got everything locked down. Let's get you out, while we still can."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "text": "It's a rare opportunity to watch a wonderful show from a fantastic seat. I'm going to have to savor this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "text": "Sora, you really are her true friend, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "text": "Now, how are you going to get up here, Cellinia?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "text": "Even if you find a shortcut, getting to me won't be easy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "But—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "text": "If I were to run away right now, do you think the Bellones and Saluzzos would just give up and call it quits?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "text": "This is a war now, my dear."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "text": "The Bellones and Saluzzos have decided to Signora Sicilia's ban on violence, and started a gang war."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "text": "Spread the word. There's only one thing we can do now: fight to the end."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "text": "Nngh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "Looks like 'fine Siracusan wine' was nothing special after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "text": "I wouldn't gloat just yet... Columbian scum..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "text": "What—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "Yes, I know. You Siracusans think the Columbian famiglie are just rowdy upstarts who haven't paid our dues."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "And yeah, there are a whole lot of incompetent idiots over in Columbia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "But what about you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "Can you even sniff out the scent of blood under your so-called 'guns and order?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "We've never looked down on Siracusa."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "But from what I've seen today, you don't even deserve my attention."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Wallach, we've got a situation at the theater!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Someone blew the seats, and Cellinia is heading straight for the third floor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "You've got five seconds for your last words."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "text": "Last words?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "text": "Heh, what's there to say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "text": "If you're really gonna do it, then tell Leontuzzo that I'm sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "What—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "text": "Leon?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "text": "You..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leontuzzo",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "text": "I'll handle this my way, Demetri."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "Signor Leontuzzo. Here I thought we could get along."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leontuzzo",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "text": "You just lost your last chance for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "Well, well, well. Turns out the heir to a great famiglia just oozes charisma after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "You've made a fool of me, and still you tell me I had a chance to make things right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leontuzzo",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "text": "What's done is done."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leontuzzo",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "text": "I'll make you a bet, Wallach."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "You're a betting man?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "Hahahaha! Signor Leon, mio amico, we're not in a dining hall or one of our offices."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "We're in a war, and only one of us walking out of this alive."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leontuzzo",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "text": "Trust me, you'll love this one."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bellone Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "Ugh, these Rossatis are a pain in the ass."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bellone Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "Your Honor? We never heard you were joining us on this one."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bellone Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "And anyway, this ain't something you can just walk into."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "text": "I'm not here to stop you. I'm not interested."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "text": "I'm looking for someone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bellone Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "Who?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bellone Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "We got one helluva mess here. Not gonna be easy to find anybody."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "text": "All I need from you is to stay out of my way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bellone Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "text": "Even if I die here, that's none of Famiglia Bellone's business."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bellone Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "text": "Suit yourself then."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "text": "There you are."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Hold it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carwash Worker",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "text": "I work here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rossati Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "Uh huh. We got rid of all the workers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "text": "Grr, what is <i>he</i> doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "text": "Look out, Dan—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Blood splatters, and a few drops splash across Lavinia's face."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carwash Worker",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "text": "Signorina Lavinia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carwash Worker",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "text": "What are you doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The 'path' opened by Lappland is doing its job. Only a short distance separates her from her old friend.\nShe lets out a soft sigh.\nChaos swirls all around her, but she knows what to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "I knew you'd come, Cellinia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "What a look in your eyes there. It's like I'm the prey."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "Let's see what the Last Texas can do!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_689_1",
      "text": "Signor, Director... is this chaos... part of the show?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "text": "Chaos?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "text": "In my opinion, Segretario Rubio, everything is in perfect order."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "text": "What comes next will be even better."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_689_1",
      "text": "...I see."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_689_1",
      "text": "You lead one of the most prestigious troupes in Volsinii, and you've put on a play unlike any other."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "text": "We do have an intermission coming up, though. You may tell me what it is you want from me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_689_1",
      "text": "What I want... isn't very complicated."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_689_1",
      "text": "With Carracci's death, the seat of Ministro dei Lavori Pubblici is now vacant."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_689_1",
      "text": "You must be thinking about who the most suitable candidate is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "text": "I take it you've decided you're that candidate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rubio",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_689_1",
      "text": "I don't think there's anyone else better suited than me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "*cough* *cough*, *cough*, *cough*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "Wow... There's still mercy in you, at a time like this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "The Saluzzo Psycho isn't gonna finish me off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "I'm not interested in a pointless fight with some punk who was never taking it seriously to begin with."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "...Hah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "text": "What are you waiting for? What do you want?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "text": "I made a bet with someone. And I hope I lose."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Wallach looks in the direction Texas went. No one can stop her from assassinating Giovanna.\nExcept Giovanna herself."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "There is nobody else in the empty room.\nTexas immediately realizes what's happening, but it's too late. A knife is already up against her neck."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "text": "Since I came to Siracusa, I've been thinking of all the different ways someone might try to kill me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "text": "But I never once thought it might be you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "text": "And I never imagined you'd let your guard down, at a time like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "text": "Did you think that when I saw you'd, I'd give you a big hug and cry 'thank goodness, Cellinia, you're still alive?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "text": "And then we'd sit down and share a drink and catch up on everything that's happened over the last few years?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "text": "I'm here to kill you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "text": "Great."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "With that word, Giovanna drops the knife in her hand.\nShe wears a radiant smile on her face, her expression full of longing, as if the murderous intent from a moment ago was but a light-hearted joke."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "text": "Long time no see, Cellinia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "text": "Long time no see, Giovanna."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
